pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: |
  讲解建议：2026 年做三项航道治理工程——续约攻坚（险滩治理）、订阅深耕（干流拓宽）、获客提效（清源节流）。三项工程共享一个原则：先改善单位经济模型，再扩大流量规模。右侧工期表的目标为建议值，可按董事会意见调整。
elements:
  - elementId: eyebrow
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 400, 18]
    content:
      style: "$eyebrow"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 远川 2025 · 水文年报

  - elementId: meta-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [600, 40, 300, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 10
      align: [right, middle]
      text: 里程 K5 / K7

  - elementId: station-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 600, 46]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$gold;">K5</span>　疏浚航道</p>

  - elementId: conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 116, 840, 24]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 2026 三项航道治理工程共享一个原则：先改善单位经济模型，再扩大流量规模。

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 152, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  # —— 左栏：三项治理工程 ——
  - elementId: p1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 168, 400, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      letterSpacing: 2
      color: "$gold"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 工程壹 · 险滩治理
  - elementId: p1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 188, 400, 26]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: 续约攻坚：把华东河段拉回警戒线以上
  - elementId: p1-detail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 218, 400, 36]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$muted"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: 华东续约率 78% → 88%；重点客户覆盖率 42% → 100%。

  - elementId: p-rule-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 270, 400, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }

  - elementId: p2-label
